{
  "name": "EAJMUSIC - System Health Monitor",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "parameters": {
        "rule": {
          "interval": [{ "field": "minutes", "minutesInterval": 5 }]
        }
      },
      "id": "schedule-trigger",
      "name": "Every 5 minutes",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.scheduleTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [220, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "url": "https://api-api.eajmusic.com/api/health",
        "options": {
          "timeout": 8000,
          "response": {
            "response": {
              "neverError": true
            }
          }
        }
      },
      "id": "check-api-health",
      "name": "Check API + DB Health",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.httpRequest",
      "typeVersion": 4.2,
      "position": [440, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "conditions": {
          "options": { "caseSensitive": true, "leftValue": "", "typeValidation": "loose" },
          "conditions": [
            {
              "id": "http-not-ok",
              "leftValue": "={{$json.statusCode}}",
              "rightValue": 200,
              "operator": { "type": "number", "operation": "notEquals" }
            }
          ],
          "combinator": "or"
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "is-unhealthy",
      "name": "Is Unhealthy?",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.if",
      "typeVersion": 2.2,
      "position": [660, 300]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "1",
              "name": "message",
              "type": "string",
              "value": "=🚨 *EAJMUSIC — API caída o degradada*\n\nStatus HTTP: {{$json.statusCode}}\nRespuesta: {{JSON.stringify($json.body || $json)}}\nHora: {{$now.toISO()}}\n\nRevisa el servidor y la conexión a la base de datos de inmediato."
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      },
      "id": "format-alert",
      "name": "Format Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [880, 220]
    },
    {
      "parameters": {
        "chatId": "REPLACE_WITH_YOUR_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID",
        "text": "={{$json.message}}",
        "additionalFields": {
          "parse_mode": "Markdown"
        }
      },
      "id": "telegram-send",
      "name": "Telegram: Send Critical Alert",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.telegram",
      "typeVersion": 1.2,
      "position": [1100, 220],
      "credentials": {
        "telegramApi": {
          "id": "REPLACE_WITH_N8N_CREDENTIAL_ID",
          "name": "EAJMUSIC Telegram Alerts"
        }
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
    "Every 5 minutes": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Check API + DB Health", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Check API + DB Health": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Is Unhealthy?", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    },
    "Is Unhealthy?": {
      "main": [
        [{ "node": "Format Alert", "type": "main", "index": 0 }],
        []
      ]
    },
    "Format Alert": {
      "main": [[{ "node": "Telegram: Send Critical Alert", "type": "main", "index": 0 }]]
    }
  },
  "active": false,
  "settings": {
    "executionOrder": "v1"
  },
  "_eajmusicNotes": {
    "why": "This workflow does NOT depend on the backend calling n8n (it can't, if it's down) — n8n polls GET /api/health itself, which per eajmusic-api's src/index.js reports the Postgres connection status too. This is how 'caídas del sistema, errores de base de datos' from the request gets covered without new backend instrumentation.",
    "beforeActivating": [
      "Same Telegram credential setup as the other workflows.",
      "Consider adding n8n's built-in error workflow (Settings > Workflows > Error Workflow) pointing at a variant of this alert, so failures INSIDE other n8n workflows also page you — that's a separate n8n-level setting, not a JSON file to import.",
      "5-minute interval is a starting point — tighten it if you want faster detection once this is live, but remember more frequent polling means more requests hitting the health endpoint."
    ]
  }
}
